%20eye.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","license":null,"text":"\"The Journal of Javad Nasrin\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Oct 2009. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13-e1","era":null,"summary":"Javad introduces his hired party: Ghazzan, Sali Oran and Keeda.","participants":["javad-nasrin","ghazzan","sali-oran","keeda"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","order":222,"story_date":"2009-10-13","storyline":"Zendikar","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":1,"quote":"I've hired Ghazzan, the first minotaur I've expeditioned with, a nearly silent but unmistakably strong man who favors the Makindi longaxe to the more traditional machete","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13#:~:text=I%27ve%20hired%20Ghazzan%2C%20the,the%20more%20traditional%20machete","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Journal of Javad Nasrin","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2009-10-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13#:~:text=I%27ve%20hired%20Ghazzan%2C%20the,the%20more%20traditional%20machete","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","license":null,"text":"\"The Journal of Javad Nasrin\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Oct 2009. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13-e2","era":null,"summary":"The Roil moves